                        <h2 class="font-headings font-bold text-5xl text-foreground leading-tight">
                            <span data-file="/screens/BuildCraftHome.jsx" data-idx="16">We Build the World's Most Iconic
                                Structures
                            </span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                            <span data-file="/screens/BuildCraftHome.jsx" data-idx="17">Founded in 1999, BuildCraft
                                Developers has grown from a small
                                residential contractor into one of the most trusted names in
                                large-scale construction. With operations spanning the Middle
                                East, Europe, and South Asia, we deliver projects that define
                                city skylines and improve communities.
                            </span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                            <span data-file="/screens/BuildCraftHome.jsx" data-idx="18">Our approach combines precision
                                engineering, sustainable
                                practices, and a relentless commitment to client satisfaction
                                — resulting in 98% on-time project delivery across all
                                sectors.
                            </span>
                        </p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-2">
